{"id":"n62269-2-2","stage":1,"title":"돼지 · 蠢猪","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62269-2-2-1","ko":"아! 배부르다.","zh":"啊，吃饱了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아!","meaning":"咦","explanation":"아：咦。","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"1","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"배부르다.","meaning":"吃饱，肚子撑","explanation":"배부르다：吃饱，肚子撑；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"배부르다","audio":"/audio/0c436675e29a835b5718.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58913","senseId":"1","lemma":"배부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배부르다","audio":"/audio/0c436675e29a835b5718.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"0c436675e29a835b","term":"배부르다","zh":"吃饱，肚子撑","audio":"/audio/0c436675e29a835b5718.mp3","entryId":"58913","definition":"胃里满满的，处于不想再吃的状态。","pronunciation":["배부르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ca28de193d4d7062014c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62269-2-2-2","ko":"돼지, 누가 뺏어 먹는다고 그걸 한꺼번에 다 먹었냐?","zh":"你这小馋猪，又没人跟你抢，怎么一下全吃了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"돼지,","meaning":"蠢猪","explanation":"돼지：蠢猪。","readings":[{"term":"돼지","audio":"/audio/7ecd93cd424c9eb2cbfc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62269","senseId":"2","lemma":"돼지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼지","audio":"/audio/7ecd93cd424c9eb2cbfc.mp3"}},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"뺏어","meaning":"夺走，抢走","explanation":"뺏다：夺走，抢走；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"뺏다","audio":"/audio/66578c75119a16c91d03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15650","senseId":"1","lemma":"뺏다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뺏어","audio":"/audio/72a84c176255a02559e3.mp3"}},{"text":"먹는다고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；는다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹는다고","audio":"/audio/7c288f1af7e0267e1f35.mp3"}},{"text":"그걸","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"2","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그걸","audio":"/audio/bf907ef577d38e391ac6.mp3"}},{"text":"한꺼번에","meaning":"一下子","explanation":"한꺼번에：一下子。","readings":[{"term":"한꺼번에","audio":"/audio/4901a1242719de241339.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72431","senseId":"1","lemma":"한꺼번에","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한꺼번에","audio":"/audio/4901a1242719de241339.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었냐?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었냐","audio":"/audio/dec845f3014af2d124d6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7ecd93cd424c9eb2","term":"돼지","zh":"蠢猪","audio":"/audio/7ecd93cd424c9eb2cbfc.mp3","entryId":"62269","definition":"(喻义)很愚蠢、很